<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo Nobel sees higher 1997 net profit.</title>
<headline>Akzo Nobel sees higher 1997 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemicals group Akzo Nobel NV said on Thursday it was maintaining its forecast that net profit for the whole of 1997 would be higher than in 1996.  </p>
<p>&quot;We maintain our expectation that net income for 1997 will exceed the 1996 figure,&quot; the company said in a statement accompanying its second-quarter results.</p>
<p>For the whole of 1996 Akzo Nobel made a net profit of 1.318 billion guilders or 18.54 guilders per share.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
